## 7. PIPELINE ARCHITECTURE — 12 STEPS

The daily pipeline runs in this exact order. Never reorder steps.

```
Step 1:  Fetch candles        — NIFTY50 + ^NSEI + ^INDIAVIX
Step 2:  Validate data        — gap detection using NSE holiday calendar
Step 3:  Compute indicators   — NIFTY50 + ^NSEI only (not ^INDIAVIX)
Step 4:  Extract features     — NIFTY50 only (includes is_liquid)
Step 5:  Market regime check  — NIFTY EMA200 AND VIX < threshold
         → IF not BULLISH: GOTO Step 11 (skip signal generation)
Step 6:  Run strategies       — TREND_PULLBACK + BREAKOUT per symbol
Step 7:  Fundamental filter   — pass/fail gate, fail-open if no data
Step 8:  Sentiment filter     — RSS fetch only for symbols with raw signals
Step 9:  Score + deduplicate  — includes is_liquid gate
Step 10: Store signals + create paper trades
Step 11: Update signal statuses
Step 12: Update paper trade statuses
```

If market_regime != 'BULLISH' at Step 5, jump to Step 11.
Signal generation (Steps 6–10) is skipped entirely.
Status updates (Steps 11–12) always run regardless of regime.

SLA: full pipeline must complete within 7 minutes.
Per-symbol timeout: 10 seconds — log warning and skip, do not abort pipeline.

