## 9. SCORING ENGINE

Weights (sum = 100):
- Trend Alignment:  +30  (is_uptrend AND ema_20 > ema_50)
- RSI Pullback:     +20  (rsi_zone = 'PULLBACK')
- Volume Spike:     +30  (is_volume_spike)
- Breakout:         +20  (is_breakout)

MIN_CONFIDENCE default = 70. This requires at least 3 of 4 factors.
Minimum passing 3-factor combo: Trend(30) + RSI(20) + Breakout(20) = 70.

If weights are ever changed, re-verify the gate is still achievable.
Add a comment to constants.js documenting the implication.

